# Response headers for the static site on Cloudflare Pages (the local app ignores this file).
# No page may be framed by another site (clickjacking of the host panel and the admin area),
# no plugins, no <base> from elsewhere, and no content-type sniffing.
#
# The full policy below is REPORT-ONLY (docs/engineering/product-audit.md, gap 7): browsers log
# what it would block and block nothing. Once a week of real use shows no reports for our own
# pages, the owner moves it into the enforced Content-Security-Policy line. Checked against a
# production build: index.html has one inline script (the theme before first paint), allowed by
# its sha256 below; if that script changes, its hash must change with it
# (web/src/securityHeaders.test.ts recomputes it). The other pages have no inline script.
# - connect-src: the API, the WorkOS sign-in domains, and Cloudflare R2's signed upload and
#   download links. Stripe Checkout and the portal are full-page redirects, so Stripe needs none.
# - media-src: blob: for music read from the person's own folders, and R2 for hosted songs.
# - script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval': the stem splitter runs ONNX Runtime as WebAssembly.
# - style-src-attr: React sets a few inline style attributes (meters, widths).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' 'sha256-mPlg8TmCXBVJkQzdWNyqnrkRKybM5dlTncWMN0B7Wm0='; style-src 'self'; style-src-attr 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self' blob: https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.selectadj.app https://api.staging.selectadj.app https://auth.selectadj.app https://auth.staging.selectadj.app https://api.workos.com https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), hid=(), midi=(self), screen-wake-lock=(self), fullscreen=(self), autoplay=(self)
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
